cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "lex-corpus-eu-eurlex, verbatim consolidated EU acts"
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it, and cite EUR-Lex as the source of the texts."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hajji
    given-names: Soufien
repository-code: "https://github.com/SFHAJJI/lex-corpus-eu-eurlex"
url: "https://law.soufien.lu"
abstract: >-
  Consolidated versions of ten EU acts (GDPR, CRR, MiFID II, PSD2, SFDR, DORA, NIS2, the AI
  Act, RED II and the Electricity Market Directive) as verbatim Cellar manifestations
  (Formex 4 and XHTML), with dated JSON metadata carrying validity intervals, an append-only
  observation chain and a SHA-256 per record. This is a deliberately small, chosen set, not
  the consolidated acquis.
keywords:
  - legal-data
  - legislation
  - european-union
  - eur-lex
  - formex
  - consolidated-legislation
  - open-data
license: CC-BY-4.0
